63470,\"title\":\"Cheo Yong\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3m7XYqhkzP6GWRBDkPQSSMxWk53.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40535714285714286,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":32200,\"title\":\"Criminal Minds: Suspect Behavior\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fifOg15YZum0KK07UKyg1gLYXRp.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2886178861788618,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":63351,\"title\":\"Narcos\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rTmal9fDbwh5F0waol2hq35U4ah.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.27477477477477474,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":131305,\"title\":\"Celebrity\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a4bWzz41C0khqh60VXOmygbwPzu.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.27364341085271315,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":2919,\"title\":\"Burn Notice\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o2fnD3SNiQjGVgA2C3ezaeh2HK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.26666666666666666,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Season 3\",\"seasonOverview\":\"After a runin with a man, Dexter initiates a friendship with his brother, Assistant District Attorney Miguel Prado. In the meantime, Rita discovers that she is pregnant, and Debra investigates the murders of a new serial killer, called \\\"The Skinner,\\\" hoping to gain a promotion to detective.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8zyoh0AtArOyTq0F2USckRGzZEU.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2008-09-28\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Our Father\",\"overview\":\"Dexter's life seems to be smoothly back on track, until he targets a dope dealer called \\\"Freebo\\\" who is also in the sights of Assistant D.A. Miguel Prado; Internal Affairs pressures Debra to rat on her new partner.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/97VmyFgGYJECb76lxvbARLU17kk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":81,\"airDate\":\"2008-09-28\",\"runtime\":58},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Finding Freebo\",\"overview\":\"Every cop in Miami is tasked with finding the fugitive Freebo, who is accused of killing the younger brother of Assistant D.A. Miguel Prado; Dexter and Rita move closer to making a big decision about their family.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gaKRlCQcuiSRjJwst4HPoUvrGWv.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"voteCount\":88,\"airDate\":\"2008-10-05\",\"runtime\":49},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"The Lion Sleeps Tonight\",\"overview\":\"Dexter encounters a fellow predator - but this one is a pedophile; a murder is pinned on Freebo but Dexter knows the truth; Dexter struggles with the fact of his growing friendship with Miguel.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2HNU4LQ9db6iDlz3QqniyNXWbaS.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"voteCount\":84,\"airDate\":\"2008-10-12\",\"runtime\":49},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"All in the Family\",\"overview\":\"Dexter scrambles to convince Rita that his marriage proposal is sincere and romantic; Miguel's vengeful brother Ramon searches desperately for their sibling's murderer, who was secretly killed by Dexter.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2WszcqVwyn9MU8uSAD9CWR9pXZy.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"voteCount\":81,\"airDate\":\"2008-10-19\",\"runtime\":54},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Turning Biminese\",\"overview\":\"Dexter hears the story of a man who has gotten away with murdering two wives for financial gain and tracks the man to Bimini. Rita has a medical emergency.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xzg0wTQNR1IjlqeCLPC8teyJwQ3.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"voteCount\":81,\"airDate\":\"2008-10-26\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Sí Se Puede\",\"overview\":\"Dexter tests Miguel to see if he is on his dark-side job. Rita questions her career path after being fired from her job. Debra believes she in some way caused another homicide while working on her current case.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nRxCveqjRzd1L7tMnmlaKKUmxXO.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":82,\"airDate\":\"2008-11-02\",\"runtime\":54},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Easy as Pie\",\"overview\":\"Dexter begins working with Miguel but they quickly have differences in selecting a potential new victim; Rita discovers that Miguel's wife suspects him of an affair; an old friend of Dexter's asks for help in ending her life.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bb4eTOgQoiukJWMQ92yoykjqtc6.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":80,\"airDate\":\"2008-11-09\",\"runtime\":57},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"The Damage a Man Can Do\",\"overview\":\"Dexter undertakes to teach Miguel the Code, but doesn't realize he's whetting his partner's thirst for blood; Debra is one step closer to finding the Skinner but a secret revealed about Anton sends him packing.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tR2cMweg59bfOvNbD1yWhLTii19.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":77,\"airDate\":\"2008-11-16\",\"runtime\":54},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"About Last Night\",\"overview\":\"The friendship between Dexter and Miguel becomes strained even as Rita revolves to confront Miguel about his suspected infidelity; Debra searches furiously for Anton when it's revealed that he was abducted by the Skinner.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2KawUqC77Z7BONLI1NSsUZeTByk.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"voteCount\":80,\"airDate\":\"2008-11-23\",\"runtime\":51},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Go Your Own Way\",\"overview\":\"A series of chess-like moves ensues when Dexter and Miguel vie for the upper hand, with Miguel winning Rita's affection by presenting her with a lavish wedding gift. Debra wonders if her relationship with Anton is worth the trouble.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rVBE0V97W4ZdFjZjnOyQWWPdxkz.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":82,\"airDate\":\"2008-11-30\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"I Had a Dream\",\"overview\":\"Dexter must find a way to get rid of Miguel despite the fact that his friend is a highly placed district attorney (and Dexter's best man); Rita discovers that Miguel has been seeing an old flame; Debra finds a new clue to the Skinner's identity.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kz2SS1ryWW3mVNnzdHWjeFxXOap.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"voteCount\":80,\"airDate\":\"2008-12-07\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Do You Take Dexter Morgan?\",\"overview\":\"Dexter attempts to calm the unstable Ramon now that Miguel is out of the picture; Debra is about to receive her detective's shield but is blind-sided with information that could derail her promotion.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eA7iCZXyED1D7GSiJHwzc2iTj4l.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"voteCount\":76,\"airDate\":\"2008-12-14\",\"runtime\":51}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2006-10-01\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}